BT 1 0 0 1 0 39 Tm 12 TL /F1 9 Tf 0 0 0 rg (1. ) Tj /F2 9 Tf (The framework does not explain WHY coherence produces subjective experience.) Tj /F1 9 Tf ( It explains when, where, and) Tj T* (how consciousness turns on and off. The hard problem remains unsolved. But the hard problem is now constrained to a) Tj T* (much smaller space: why does coherent neural activity at gamma_c produce experience? This is a better question than) Tj T* ("why does any information processing produce experience?" because it identifies the specific physical conditions.) Tj T* ET
